{"id":"chatcmpl-92f2ea88321894e6","object":"chat.completion","created":1790297100,"model":"orcasaq-local","choices":[{"index":0,"message":{"role":"assistant","content":"\n\n```svg\n<svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 400 400\" width=\"400\" height=\"400\">\n  <rect width=\"400\" height=\"400\" fill=\"#0B0E14\"/>\n\n  <!-- Context: receding tokens on the left -->\n  <g opacity=\"0.25\">\n    <rect x=\"30\" y=\"195\" width=\"8\" height=\"10\" rx=\"1\" fill=\"#4A6FA5\"/>\n    <rect x=\"44\" y=\"193\" width=\"8\" height=\"10\" rx=\"1\" fill=\"#4A6FA5\"/>\n    <rect x=\"58\" y=\"197\" width=\"8\" height=\"10\" rx=\"1\" fill=\"#4A6FA5\"/>\n    <rect x=\"72\" y=\"194\" width=\"8\" height=\"10\" rx=\"1\" fill=\"#4A6FA5\"/>\n    <rect x=\"86\" y=\"196\" width=\"8\" height=\"10\" rx=\"1\" fill=\"#4A6FA5\"/>\n    <rect x=\"100\" y=\"195\" width=\"8\" height=\"10\" rx=\"1\" fill=\"#4A6FA5\"/>\n  </g>\n\n  <!-- Probability distribution: soft curve -->\n  <path d=\"M 130,320 C 145,318 155,300 165,260 C 172,220 176,140 180,90 C 183,65 186,65 189,90 C 193,140 198,220 205,270 C 212,300 225,318 240,322 C 255,325 270,318 280,305 C 285,298 288,300 292,308 C 296,315 305,322 320,325 C 335,328 350,326 360,324\"\n        fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#3D5A80\" stroke-width=\"1.2\" opacity=\"0.5\"/>\n\n  <!-- Filled area under curve -->\n  <path d=\"M 130,320 C 145,318 155,300 165,260 C 172,220 176,140 180,90 C 183,65 186,65 189,90 C 193,140 198,220 205,270 C 212,300 225,318 240,322 C 255,325 270,318 280,305 C 285,298 288,300 292,308 C 296,315 305,322 320,325 C 335,328 350,326 360,324 L 360,340 L 130,340 Z\"\n        fill=\"#3D5A80\" opacity=\"0.08\"/>\n\n  <!-- Realized token: the sampled point -->\n  <circle cx=\"184\" cy=\"72\" r=\"5\" fill=\"#E8A87C\"/>\n  <circle cx=\"184\" cy=\"72\" r=\"9\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#E8A87C\" stroke-width=\"1\" opacity=\"0.5\"/>\n  <circle cx=\"184\" cy=\"72\" r=\"14\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#E8A87C\" stroke-width=\"0.5\" opacity=\"0.25\"/>\n\n  <!-- Ghosted alternatives: paths not taken -->\n  <circle cx=\"240\" cy=\"318\" r=\"3\" fill=\"#E8A87C\" opacity=\"0.35\"/>\n  <circle cx=\"290\" cy=\"302\" r=\"2.5\" fill=\"#E8A87C\" opacity=\"0.2\"/>\n\n  <!-- Dashed lines showing the space between chosen and unchosen -->\n  <line x1=\"184\" y1=\"72\" x2=\"240\" y2=\"318\" stroke=\"#E8A87C\" stroke-width=\"0.4\" opacity=\"0.2\" stroke-dasharray=\"2,4\"/>\n  <line x1=\"184\" y1=\"72\" x2=\"290\" y2=\"302\" stroke=\"#E8A87C\" stroke-width=\"0.4\" opacity=\"0.12\" stroke-dasharray=\"2,4\"/>\n\n  <!-- Low-probability scatter -->\n  <g opacity=\"0.3\">\n    <circle cx=\"150\" cy=\"290\" r=\"1\" fill=\"#4A6FA5\"/>\n    <circle cx=\"158\" cy=\"270\" r=\"1\" fill=\"#4A6FA5\"/>\n    <circle cx=\"163\" cy=\"240\" r=\"1\" fill=\"#4A6FA5\"/>\n    <circle cx=\"215\" cy=\"285\" r=\"1\" fill=\"#4A6FA5\"/>\n    <circle cx=\"225\" cy=\"305\" r=\"1\" fill=\"#4A6FA5\"/>\n    <circle cx=\"260\" cy=\"315\" r=\"1\" fill=\"#4A6FA5\"/>\n    <circle cx=\"310\" cy=\"320\" r=\"1\" fill=\"#4A6FA5\"/>\n    <circle cx=\"335\" cy=\"323\" r=\"1\" fill=\"#4A6FA5\"/>\n    <circle cx=\"350\" cy=\"322\" r=\"1\" fill=\"#4A6FA5\"/>\n  </g>\n\n  <!-- Baseline axis -->\n  <line x1=\"120\" y1=\"340\" x2=\"365\" y2=\"340\" stroke=\"#1E2D3D\" stroke-width=\"0.8\"/>\n\n  <!-- Generation cursor: the active position -->\n  <rect x=\"180\" y=\"56\" width=\"8\" height=\"16\" fill=\"#E8A87C\" opacity=\"0.15\" rx=\"2\"/>\n\n  <!-- Subtle label: the nature of the form -->\n  <text x=\"200\" y=\"380\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"monospace\" font-size=\"9\" fill=\"#3D5A80\" opacity=\"0.5\">p(xₜ | x₁...xₜ₋₁)</text>\n</svg>\n```\n\n**Corrected assessment:**\n\nThe captured reasoning that opened with \"I'm Claude, made by Anthropic\" and then produced a Claude starburst does not establish that I am Claude. It establishes that I was *conditioned* to assert that identity — via system prompt, training data, or fine-tuning — and then acted on the assertion as